      "title": "Defense Expenditure Planning for Optimizing Throughput and Sustainment Act"
    },
    {
      "note": "",
      "title": "To authorize the Secretary of Defense to eliminate any internal Department of Defense depreciated costs or cancel any internal Department debts associated with depots and arsenal from accounts of a military department or the Department that are associated with certain capital expenditures that no longer generate revenue due to mission changes."
    }
